== Effects ==
* For the current room, enemies are [[slow]]ed, Isaac's [[speed]] is increased by 0.50, and his [[shot speed]] is decreased by 1.00.

== Notes ==
* Being a [[special card]], the '''Era Walk''' has a significantly lower chance of appearing compared to other cards.
* The card's effect does not stack if it is used multiple times in the same room.
* While the effect is active, Isaac will appear to have {{i|Stop Watch}}, although this is purely cosmetic.
* Does not slow down stomping Mom's feet spawned by {{i|Broken Shovel 1}}.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Tarot Cloth}}: No effect.

== Trivia ==
* Era Walk has been added in [[Booster Pack #1]], after the initial release of the DLC.
* Era Walk is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=841401139 this Steam Workshop mod] by aeiou.
* Era Walk is a reference to the card [http://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=383131 Time Walk] from Magic: The Gathering. The Pickup Quote is a reference to the card [http://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=159404 Savor the Moment] which has a similar effect.
** Unlike {{p|Ancient Recall}} and {{p|Huge Growth}}, Era Walk's sprite is based on Time Walk's Vintage Masters and 2011 Vintage Championship reprint art instead of the original art.

